  # Is It Me or Is It Meno?

  Support page for the iOS app. A perimenopause symptom
  tracker. All data stays on your phone.

  ## Need help?

  Email **steven.nilsen@gmail.com** with your question or
  feedback. Please include your iOS version and a brief 
  description of what you were doing when the problem occurred. 
  Do not send any health data; we do not need it to help you.                                       

  ## Common questions

  ### Is my data on a server somewhere?

  No. Everything you log lives only on your iPhone. The
  app sends no analytics, no telemetry, no error reports. 
  Your data leaves the device only when you choose to 
  share a report (PDF) using your phone's share sheet.
                                                          
  ### How do I delete my data?                          

  Settings, then Data and Privacy, then "Delete all my    
  logs" removes everything you have logged. "Delete everything" also    
  removes your profile and preferences. Deleting the app from your 
  phone also removes all data, since nothing is stored elsewhere.
                                                          
  ### Is the app a medical device or a diagnosis?
                                                          
  No. The app is informational. It records what you log 
  and presents the  patterns. Anything in the report is something 
  to discuss with your healthcare provider
  if you want clinical confirmation.
                                                          
  ### What is the MRS?                                  

  The Menopause Rating Scale, an eleven-factor instrument
  used by clinicians to characterize the menopausal transition.
  The app uses the published wordings.
                                                          
